-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">料理</span><rt>りょうり</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しせん\" data-defn=\"Sichuan (China)/Szechuan/Szechwan\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">四川</span><rt>しせん</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"りょうり\" data-defn=\"cooking/cookery/cuisine/meal/food/dish/item on a menu; dealing with something/handling/administratio\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">料理</span><rt>りょうり</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"カントン\" data-defn=\"Guangdong (China)/Kwangtung; Guangzhou/Kwangchow/Canton (China)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">広東</span><rt>カントン</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"りょうり\" data-defn=\"cooking/cookery/cuisine/meal/food/dish/item on a menu; dealing with something/handling/administratio\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">料理</span><rt>りょうり</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"など\" data-defn=\"and so on / etc.\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N4\"><span class=\"si\">など</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たべ\" data-defn=\"to eat; to live on (e.g. a salary)/to live off/to subsist on (食べる)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">食べ</span><rt>たべ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たい\" data-defn=\"want to (verbal suffix of desire)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">たい</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"もの\" data-defn=\"thing / object / item\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">もの</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なに\" data-defn=\"what; you-know-what/that thing\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">何</span><rt>なに</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"でも\" data-defn=\"even / or something / but\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">でも</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たべ\" data-defn=\"to eat; to live on (e.g. a salary)/to live off/to subsis